          "source_id": "web-computer-science-cpp-pointer",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-ce3a391eb822"
        }
      ],
      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-ce3a391eb822",
          "exact": "Pointers of every type have a special value known as null pointer value of that type. A pointer whose value is null does not point to an object or a function (the behavior of dereferencing a null pointer is undefined), and compares equal to all pointers of the same type whose value is also null."
        }
      ],
      "observations": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-ce3a391eb822",
          "subject": "null pointer value",
          "predicate": "is",
          "object": "a special value of every pointer type; a null pointer does not point to an object or function, dereferencing it is undefined, and it compares equal to same-type null pointers"
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "WIKI-001",
        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文 [0,296) 逐项覆盖 claim 的四个断言：\"Pointers of every type have a special value known as null pointer value of that type\" 对应\"每种指针类型都有特殊空指针值\"；\"does not point to an object or a function\" 对应\"空指针不指向任何对象或函数\"；\"the behavior of dereferencing a null pointer is undefined\" 对应\"解引用空指针是未定义行为\"；\"compares equal to all pointers of the same type whose value is also null\" 对应\"同类型空指针彼此相等\"。claim 为引文的完整忠实转述，无过度断言。单条引文，无多源一致/冲突或独立性问题。",
